[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3781.829, "timestamp": "01:03:01", "text": "胃病之类的。就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3783.43, "timestamp": "01:03:03", "text": "她找食物真的很难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3786.789, "timestamp": "01:03:06", "text": "这是纯素的，这是纯素的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3788.71, "timestamp": "01:03:08", "text": "所以如果你是素食主义者，那就会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3790.309, "timestamp": "01:03:10", "text": "难的。如果你是素食主义者，那将会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3792.309, "timestamp": "01:03:12", "text": "难得要死。但如果你不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3794.069, "timestamp": "01:03:14", "text": "非素食者，比如你什么都吃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3795.67, "timestamp": "01:03:15", "text": "你不在乎。你只要吃就行了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3798.309, "timestamp": "01:03:18", "text": "那么，这里就是最好的地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3800.95, "timestamp": "01:03:20", "text": "永远无法离开。我向上帝发誓。生的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3803.51, "timestamp": "01:03:23", "text": "鸡。尽量在环境好的地方吃。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3805.829, "timestamp": "01:03:25", "text": "他们就在那里把鸡肉切开，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3808.23, "timestamp": "01:03:28", "text": "他们就直接把食物盛到盘子里。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3810.15, "timestamp": "01:03:30", "text": "你一开始可能会感到非常厌恶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3811.829, "timestamp": "01:03:31", "text": "因为它未经加工，对吧？我们从不吃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3814.87, "timestamp": "01:03:34", "text": "生的。是的。但出乎意料的是，它是白色的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3818.15, "timestamp": "01:03:38", "text": "肉呈白色。他们真的把它剪掉了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3820.23, "timestamp": "01:03:40", "text": "像薄薄的，然后你就可以像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3822.309, "timestamp": "01:03:42", "text": "煮熟后蘸酱汁食用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3825.19, "timestamp": "01:03:45", "text": "真不错。尤其是如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3828.39, "timestamp": "01:03:48", "text": "比如寿司之类的。但如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3830.15, "timestamp": "01:03:50", "text": "就像普通的鱼一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3831.829, "timestamp": "01:03:51", "text": "然后他们把它切成多块，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3835.51, "timestamp": "01:03:55", "text": "生的最好啊，啊，你不必"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3837.99, "timestamp": "01:03:57", "text": "甚至不用担心你会做什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3839.67, "timestamp": "01:03:59", "text": "呼叫骨"}]